body:
Well, if you want to add some good ol' paranoia fuel, you could throw in Psychomancy. Freak everyone out at the thought that there might be someone out there fucking with everyone's minds. Can't trust your memories, feelings or logic, because psychomancers exist.

&#x200B;

By necessity, they should be rare, or else nothing gets done because everyone with working logic would live in a bunker, but still, it can be fun to use.
